message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "plg-metrics: product-led-growth analytics and experiment readouts validated against synthetic ground truth"
abstract: >-
  Ordered funnels, activation search, cohort retention, and an A/B experiment
  readout with SRM checks, CUPED, multiple-testing correction, mSPRT sequential
  testing, and a Bayesian probability to beat control, running locally on
  DuckDB over Parquet.
